<title>USA: Fluke, Tektronix suit resolved.</title>
<headline>Fluke, Tektronix suit resolved.</headline>
<dateline>EVERETT, Wash. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fluke Corp said the trade dress infringement lawsuit filed against Tektronix Inc in June 1996 was concluded in Federal District Court in Seattle.</p>
<p>The company said on April 24, the court entered a final order permanently enjoining Tektronix from marketing and selling its 800 Series DMMs and 510 and 520 digital thermometers.</p>
</text>
